flowchart TD
  Start[Generate daily plan] --> Capacity[Convert target minutes to capacity]
  Capacity --> Due[Load overdue and due reviews]
  Due --> Weak[Load weak items]
  Weak --> Lesson[Load current lesson]
  Lesson --> New{Review load high?}
  New -->|Yes| Suppress[Reduce or stop new items]
  New -->|No| AddNew[Add new vocabulary]
  Suppress --> Rotate[Add rotating skill block if capacity remains]
  AddNew --> Rotate
  Rotate --> Trim[Trim to selected light/standard/thorough/all mode]
  Trim --> Save[Save plan snapshot]
